WEBVTT - SpotAsk External Ask Hotkey Workflow Demo (30s)

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
Working on code when a question comes to mind...

00:03.500 --> 00:05.000
Press ⌥Space anywhere on Mac to summon SpotAsk.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.500
Write your prompt once while the thought is fresh.

00:07.500 --> 00:08.500
Choose ChatGPT (⌘5) for conceptual explanations.

00:08.500 --> 00:10.500
Default browser opens chatgpt.com with your prompt pre-filled.

00:10.500 --> 00:12.000
Press Send to submit — no API key required in SpotAsk.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.500
ChatGPT answers directly in your authenticated web workspace.

00:14.500 --> 00:16.000
Back in your editor, a repository task needs local inspection.

00:16.000 --> 00:18.500
Press ⌥Space again to write your next task in the same box.

00:18.500 --> 00:19.500
Choose OMP (⌘6) to dispatch directly to your local CLI agent.

00:19.500 --> 00:22.000
Terminal opens with prompt safely quoted into your agent command.

00:22.000 --> 00:25.000
Agent inspects tests and code in place — zero clipboard copying.

00:25.000 --> 00:26.500
Inspection complete: diagnosis and fix provided without editing files.

00:26.500 --> 00:30.000
One hotkey. You choose the destination.
